            "title": "abandoned place ballerina",
            "summary": "i recently participated at a workshop with jens burger (www.jensburger.de) and the talented alina (alinazumberge@gmail.com). it was a lot of fun and an amazing&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>i recently participated at a workshop with jens burger (<a href=\"http://www.jensburger.de\">www.jensburger.de</a>) and the talented alina (alinazumberge@gmail.com). it was a lot of fun and an amazing experience to shoot in this gorgeous location (heilstätte grabowsee) with very professional people. here is a selection of images i was able to make.</p>\n<p>set 1</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6884.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1493\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6884-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"597\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6903.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1920\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6903-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6908.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1279\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6908-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6977_02.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1279\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6977_02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>set 2</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7015.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7015-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7046.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7046-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>set 3</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7139_02.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7139_02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7180_02.jpg\" data-size=\"1280x1920\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7180_02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1152\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7277.jpg\" data-size=\"1493x1920\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7277-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"988\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
