            "title": "visual flow",
            "summary": "i have changed. i have discovered a new style for me that i like to persue. i call it visual flow. instead of trying&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">i have changed. i have discovered a new style for me that i like to persue. i call it visual flow. instead of trying to tell as much story as possible with one image i try to focus on the essential elements in one frame and create a story by linking several images via visual flow.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>island mood</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6133_01.jpg\" data-size=\"6231x2300\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6133_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"283\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6115.jpg\" data-size=\"6238x2303\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6115-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"284\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6136_02.jpg\" data-size=\"4105x4105\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6136_02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6134_01.jpg\" data-size=\"4160x4159\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6134_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6138_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3832x3832\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6138_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>hotel flavor</p>\n<di