gure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6706.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6706-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6734_01.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1079\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/50/gallery/DSCF6734_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
