            "content_html": "<p>the time from new years eve to mid of march is a dark dull time in germany. no light, no color - we have to live from what we make ourselves. so i created some colorful and lightstrong images for you.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7325.jpg\" data-size=\"4159x4159\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7325-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7347.jpg\" data-size=\"4159x4159\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7347-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7370_01.jpg\" data-size=\"5083x2859\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7370_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7407.jpg\" data-size=\"3046x3046\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7407-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7427_01.jpg\" data-size=\"4159x2339\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7427_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7489.jpg\" data-size=\"4159x2339\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/44/gallery/DSCF7489-t