            "id": "https://www.ciclista.de/brilliant-corners/",
            "url": "https://www.ciclista.de/brilliant-corners/",
            "title": "brilliant corners",
            "summary": "or how i learned to enjoy minimalism in contemporary greek architecture. during our recent vacation we stayed at the agapi beach hotel. at first&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>or how i learned to enjoy minimalism in contemporary greek architecture.</p>\n<p>during our recent vacation we stayed at the agapi beach hotel. at first the clean minimalist architecture did not resonate very strongly with me but after some time i realized that the interaction between light and the simple geometrical shapes is striking. also the contrast between the bold clean surfaces and the beautiful flowers in the garden is a joy to behold.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110053.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4124\" height=\"2762\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110053-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110053-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110053-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110053-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110055.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4183\" height=\"2802\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110055-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110055-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110055-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110055-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110056-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4259\" height=\"2852\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110056-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110056-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110056-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110056-2-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110064.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4268\" height=\"2858\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110064-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110064-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110064-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110064-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110097.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4019\" height=\"2692\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110097-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110097-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110097-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110097-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110100.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3697\" height=\"2477\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110100-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110100-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110100-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110100-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110153.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3353\" height=\"2245\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110153-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110153-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110153-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110153-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110166.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3765\" height=\"2521\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110166-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110166-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110166-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110166-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110520.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4253\" height=\"2819\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110520-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110520-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110520-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110520-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110161.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4288\" height=\"2872\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110161-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110161-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110161-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110161-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110386.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4288\" height=\"2872\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110386-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110386-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110386-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110386-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/P1110389.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4288\" height=\"2872\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110389-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110389-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110389-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/26/responsive/P1110389-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>",
